# Kind $2F (Kind2FStart, $83:B4BE) on the first level, the camera put at
# x $0240, y $0080 and Aladdin at x $0250, so the two at x $0292 and
# $02F2 (records $0BFB, $0C9B) start:
# 1. with the copier RAM on (cartram): its write at $70:1000 reads back,
#    and it puts Aladdin at x 0 ($83:B4CD);
# 2. without it, left for 600 frames: they rise, land and walk, and the
#    walk runs out ($83:B5A7). At frame 300 the one at record $0BFB,
#    walking left on the ground at y $01C0, is moved to x $0175, just
#    right of the block at x $0130-$016F (tiles read from a WRAM dump):
#    it walks into it and turns ($83:B595).
# 3. Then the one at record $0C9B put in its downed state (Kind2FSecond,
#    $83:B643) by state $8C, with a shot counted ($42 = 1) and its facing
#    $80: the hit test reads the facing ($83:B657) and clears its bit 7
#    ($83:B665).
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
cartram on
wait 30
poke 001773 40,02
poke 0019E5 40,02
poke 001777 80,00
poke 0019E9 80,00
poke 0008E7 50,02
poke 0008EA 00,01
wait 30
cartram off
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 40,02
poke 0019E5 40,02
poke 001777 80,00
poke 0019E9 80,00
poke 0008E7 50,02
poke 0008EA 00,01
wait 300
poke 000C07 75,01
wait 300
poke 000CDD 01
poke 000CAF 80
poke 000C9B 8C
wait 30
